GunyahVM favorite migration
---------------------------
The favorite helper, GSettings migration key and autostart entry originate in
https://github.com/yzddmr6/xiaomipad-8pro-mainline
commits 6f377053a29fcc5688fe10bd84ab55f111a1013e and
71342ec3392264261e4cdca0f71c83ebe44d336e (MIT, Copyright 2026 yzddmr6).
The append-once algorithm is retained. Device integration changes the schema
and installed path to erhai, declares the Python introspection dependencies,
and omits the legacy autostart phase so the systemd XDG generator can launch it.
The MIT license is shipped as gunyahvm-favorite.COPYING in the support package.

